App, Offline AI Assistant.

Say "Offline Angis AI Assistant".
Say "Type anything. I will answer, read emotion, pull keywords, summarize, and classify it.".

Ask input with prompt "You: " as userText.

Use ai chat with text: userText as aiReply.
Use ai sentiment with text: userText as mood.
Use ai keywords with text: userText as keywords.
Use ai summarize with text: userText, sentences: 1 as summary.
Use ai count_words with text: userText as wordCount.
Use ai detect_language with text: userText as language.
Use ai classify with text: userText, categories: {music: [rap, beat, song, studio, lyric, rhyme, album], tech: [computer, code, network, cyber, ai, python, app], health: [pain, doctor, medicine, body, diagnosis], life: [love, family, friend, money, work]} as category.

Use json stringify with value: keywords as keywordsText.

Say "".
Say "AI reply:".
Show aiReply.

Say "".
Say "Text analysis:".
Say "Mood:".
Show mood.
Say "Keywords:".
Show keywordsText.
Say "Summary:".
Show summary.
Say "Word count:".
Show wordCount.
Say "Language:".
Show language.
Say "Category:".
Show category.

If mood is positive:
    Say "AI note: I hear good energy in that.".
If mood is negative:
    Say "AI note: That sounds heavy. I am here with you.".
If mood is neutral:
    Say "AI note: I read that as calm or informational.".
